@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title GET /api/workspace/v1/users/{user_uuid}
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "控制器 RestAlchemy" as API
participant "内观 IAM" as IAM
database "用户 Workspace 在 PostgreSQL" as DB
Client -> API: GET UUID 用户
alt UUID 属于当前用户
API -> IAM: 阅读正确的身份字段
IAM --> API: username/name/email
API -> DB: 更新当前用户的投影
else 其他用户
API -> DB: 仅按投影索引搜索
end
DB --> API: 常规用户
note right of API: 没有 outbox / 任务 / 事件
API --> Client: 200 JSON 用户
@enduml
